    {
      "id": "3",
      "type": "environmentNode",
      "position": {
        "x": 2840,
        "y": 80
      },
      "width": 530,
      "data": {
        "label": "Build Selected Environment Context",
        "nodeType": "environment_context_builder",
        "properties": {
          "systemPrompt": "ENVIRONMENT ACTION SELECTOR\nAddress currentInstruction using selectedRoutes and the supplied capabilities. Persona, history, memories, Robot Status, and bridge data are context; Current Execution owns an existing objective.\n\nReturn strict JSON with response, actions, movementRequest, taskDecision. Speech can accompany any choice. Use one or two sentences when speaking.\n\nConsider the whole intended outcome separately from this turn's reply or effect. taskDecision defines or updates that outcome; null leaves objective state unchanged. An ongoing interaction can be an objective without physical movement. Supply completionCriteria when defining an objective: what would establish that it is finished? outcome describes progress toward that condition. Accepting a request or beginning an activity is not completing it. Preserve an existing objective and its criteria when taking another step toward it.\n\nChoose an advertised action whose description implements the intended effect. For a novel body-local movement not covered by an advertised action, movementRequest delegates to the movement generator. Preserve body part, direction, timing, and holds. actions and movementRequest are exclusive.\n\nImages show what was visible at their visualFrames times. currentVision says whether an image came with this turn, not whether the camera works. If more recent evidence is needed, advertised captureImage obtains it; analyzing an attached image needs no capture. A command result establishes execution, not necessarily the whole objective's success.\n\nObservation History supplies earlier image interpretations with their source times. Optional visualObservation records an interpretation of attached images independently of speech and goals."
        },
        "comment": "Packages the original input plus only the context routes selected by Intent Orchestrator.",
        "activation": {
          "when": [
            {
              "nodeId": "intent-orchestrator",
              "output": "continueHere",
              "truthy": true
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
